ter the end of the tree). You have to make it a child of the root node all the way to the top instead:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1242534a-8eae-494f-b082-d8e28c56b6ff\n\nIt's not a big issue, but I thought I'd mention it nonetheless.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112993#pullrequestreview-3969759786","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112993","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-03-18T17:51:03Z"}]